# The brain CLI parses page frontmatter line by line and cannot read CRLF, so
# every page shows as "(untitled)" in `brain list-pages` and in the SessionStart
# summary. core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, which
# means a fresh clone breaks the brain even though the CLI always writes LF.
# Pin these to LF so that cannot happen again.
brain/** text eol=lf
BRAIN.md text eol=lf
